# Echo Sound Lab Environment Configuration

# ============================================================================
# GEMINI API CONFIGURATION
# ============================================================================

# Server-only Google Gemini API key (required)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Server-only provenance manifest signing key (required for signed export sidecars)
ESL_MANIFEST_SIGNING_KEY=replace_with_a_long_random_secret

# Gemini model version (optional, defaults to latest available)
# Update this whenever a new stable Gemini version is released in the API
# Examples:
#   - gemini-3-flash-preview (current latest, better reasoning)
#   - gemini-2.5-flash (stable, proven)
#   - gemini-3-pro-preview (when available)
#   - Leave unset to use default (gemini-3-flash-preview)
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3-flash-preview

# ============================================================================
# HOW TO UPDATE GEMINI MODEL VERSION
# ============================================================================
#
# When Google releases a new stable Gemini model:
#
# 1. Update the GEMINI_MODEL variable above with the new model name
# 2. No code changes needed—the engine will automatically use the new version
# 3. The system is designed to work seamlessly with any Gemini version
#
# This allows Echo Sound Lab to stay current with latest AI improvements
# without requiring code modifications.
# ============================================================================
